Change `justify-content` to `flex-end`:

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end; /* pushes the button to the right */
  align-items: center;
  height: 200px;
  padding-right: 16px;       /* optional breathing room from the edge */
}
```

If the container holds other items and you only want the button pushed right, leave the container alone and give the button `margin-left: auto;` instead.
